# Title: Webshell ReGeorg Detection Via Web Logs
# ID: 2ea44a60-cfda-11ea-87d0-0242ac130003
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Cian Heasley
# Date: 2020-08-04
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1505.003
# Description: Certain strings in the uri_query field when combined with null referer and null user agent can indicate activity associated with the webshell ReGeorg.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((@cs-uri-query:*cmd=read* OR @cs-uri-query:*connect&target* OR @cs-uri-query:*cmd=connect* OR @cs-uri-query:*cmd=disconnect* OR @cs-uri-query:*cmd=forward*)) AND (-@cs-referer:* AND -@cs-user-agent:* AND @cs-method:"POST"))
